<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate flat, 3-mo and 6-mo drops.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate flat, 3-mo and 6-mo drops.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) was steady on Friday for the one-month maturity and dropped one basis point for three month and eased two basis points for six month, the National Bank of Hungary said.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 20.80 percent, the three-month rate at 20.72 percent, while the six-month rate was set at 20.48 percent.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
